        <div id="post-699" class="post-699 post type-post status-publish format-standard hentry category-nhibernate">

          <div class="post-header">
           <h3 class="post-title"><a href="http://cromwellhaus.com/2007/11/nhibernate-query-generator-with-visual-studio-2008/" rel="bookmark" title="Permanent Link: NHibernate Query Generator with Visual Studio 2008">NHibernate Query Generator with Visual Studio 2008</a></h3>
           <p class="post-date">
            <span class="month">Nov</span>
            <span class="day">19</span>
           </p>
           <p class="post-author">
            <span class="info">Posted by <a href="http://cromwellhaus.com/author/cromwellryan/" title="Posts by cromwellryan ">cromwellryan</a> in <a href="http://cromwellhaus.com/category/nhibernate/" title="View all posts in NHibernate" rel="category tag">NHibernate</a> | <a href="http://cromwellhaus.com/2007/11/nhibernate-query-generator-with-visual-studio-2008/#comments" class="comments"  title="Comment on NHibernate Query Generator with Visual Studio 2008"><span class="dsq-postid" rel="699 /blogs/ryanc/archive/2007/11/19/nhibernate-query-generator-with-visual-studio-2008.aspx">3 Comments</span></a>              </span>
           </p>
